{"nodes": [{"id": "myrosta_multiorg_build_multi_org_build_plan", "label": "Multi-Org Build Plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-08-19", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "myrosta_multiorg_build_multi_tenant_foundation", "label": "Multi-Tenant Foundation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One codebase serving many isolated orgs without a rewrite: auth, RLS allow-list, per-org blob and org-filtered realtime already exist, so the plan only adds an org dimension; onboarding = insert a row + invite an admin."}, {"id": "myrosta_multiorg_build_isolation_test", "label": "Isolation Test", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hard gate: no second real org until Org A is provably denied Org B (12/12 probes both directions); proves RLS only - edge functions and realtime checked separately; re-run after any RLS change."}, {"id": "myrosta_multiorg_build_org_scoped_rls_migration", "label": "Org-Scoped RLS Migration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Adds org to roster_members (default ed-default keeps existing rows working), (org,email) PK, org-scoped helpers, my_orgs(), orgs registry; never touches org_state contents, so rollback is policies-only. Never revert the composite PK on rollback."}, {"id": "myrosta_multiorg_build_org_resolution_and_picker", "label": "Org Resolution and Picker", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "resolveOrg() from my_orgs() at sign-in with a picker for multi-org users; falls back to single-org mode when my_orgs() is absent, so the app deploys before the SQL migration with zero behaviour change."}, {"id": "myrosta_multiorg_build_branding_and_feature_flags", "label": "Branding and Feature Flags", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Per-org S.branding/S.features live as data in each org's blob - already synced and RLS-isolated, defaults reproduce the current look; includes per-org role noun and hospital-grouped picker."}, {"id": "myrosta_multiorg_build_org_scoped_device_cache", "label": "Org-Scoped Device Cache", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A single shared cache key would merge one group's unsynced edits into another group's live roster for a legitimate dual-group member; orgKey() scopes cache, dirty flag and merge base per org."}, {"id": "myrosta_multiorg_build_multi_org_edge_functions", "label": "Multi-Org Edge Functions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nearly missed: push-send trusted the org in the request body (cross-org push hole), ics was hard-wired to one org, notify functions read the allow-list unscoped; all four now org-scoped and fail-closed, must be redeployed with ORG/MYROSTA_ORG unset and CRON_SECRET set."}, {"id": "myrosta_multiorg_build_deploy_order", "label": "Deploy Order", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "APP then EDGE FUNCTIONS then SQL: the new app is provably inert on the old schema and functions carry fallbacks, while SQL-first would let old cached browsers issue unscoped member deletes stripping a person from every org."}, {"id": "myrosta_multiorg_build_adversarial_audit", "label": "Adversarial Audit", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "19 Aug: four independent audits over the finished branch - 20 findings fixed same day, 95/95 tests, 26 stored-XSS interpolations escaped, rollback dependency bug and sign-out cache leak closed; realtime isolation verified on staging."}], "edges": [{"source": "myrosta_multiorg_build_multi_org_build_plan", "target": "myrosta_multiorg_build_multi_tenant_foundation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "myrosta_multiorg_build_multi_org_build_plan", "target": "myrosta_multiorg_build_isolation_test", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "myrosta_multiorg_build_multi_org_build_plan", "target": "myrosta_multiorg_build_org_scoped_rls_migration", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "myrosta_multiorg_build_multi_org_build_plan", "target": "myrosta_multiorg_build_org_resolution_and_picker", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MYROSTA-MULTIORG-BUILD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "myrosta_multiorg_build_multi_org_build_plan", "target": "myrosta_multiorg_build_branding_and_feature_flags", "relat